@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:VerificationReceipt a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Verification Receipt"; skos:definition "A receipt binding verifier identity, subject identity, evidence, consequence, replay path, and standing." .